1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,660 --> 00:01:38,260
=Episode 18=

4
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:43,070
So that's what it was all about.

5
00:01:45,760 --> 00:01:46,870
He heard the word "Chun"

6
00:01:47,350 --> 00:01:48,350
and forgot everything else.

7
00:01:52,510 --> 00:01:53,400
To be honest,

8
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:54,310
I used to

9
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:56,280
look down on your friend.

10
00:01:57,560 --> 00:01:58,400
A man like him

11
00:01:58,790 --> 00:02:00,230
only cares about fame and power,

12
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:02,680
weighing every move.

13
00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:04,790
He's nothing like us.

14
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:07,590
Beneath that rough exterior,

15
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:09,030
there's actually a good heart.

16
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:13,430
I've known Wenji for a long time.

17
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:14,960
He's a man of true feeling.

18
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:17,240
But born into an official's family,

19
00:02:17,430 --> 00:02:18,150
raised in luxury and power,

20
00:02:18,630 --> 00:02:20,520
he carries burdens he can't escape.

21
00:02:21,030 --> 00:02:22,120
They're all sons of officials,

22
00:02:22,630 --> 00:02:24,080
yet Wenji still hesitates,

23
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:25,710
while others

24
00:02:27,190 --> 00:02:28,470
have lost their minds.

25
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:31,870
Not all officials are alike.

26
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:34,750
If Liu Wenji's father came to Sheng'an,

27
00:02:35,470 --> 00:02:36,750
even with gold in hand,

28
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:38,400
he couldn't get past Zhang Jun's gate.

29
00:02:43,470 --> 00:02:44,840
You want to help him get justice?

30
00:02:47,430 --> 00:02:48,280
Is it that obvious?

31
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:51,470
You were talking about Liu Wenji,

32
00:02:52,150 --> 00:02:53,520
but you were already plotting

33
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:55,470
how to make Zhang Jun beg for death.

34
00:02:58,190 --> 00:02:59,840
Your Highness,
that's a frightening thought.

35
00:03:01,870 --> 00:03:03,360
If you don't need my help,

36
00:03:04,310 --> 00:03:05,680
I'll just sit back and do nothing.

37
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:07,680
Your Highness,

38
00:03:08,310 --> 00:03:09,030
of course I need your help.

39
00:03:15,190 --> 00:03:15,520
Your Highness.

40
00:03:17,150 --> 00:03:18,080
Do something for me.

41
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,240
Just say the word.

42
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:26,280
Understood.

43
00:03:30,080 --> 00:03:31,190
Having tea, Cuihua?

44
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:34,680
Not bad-looking.

45
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:36,210
- Mind your words, sir.
- I'll come see you later!

46
00:03:36,260 --> 00:03:36,980
(Dear, look.)

47
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:44,630
Bring out the food!

48
00:03:56,660 --> 00:03:57,250
(Cuiyun Tower)

49
00:03:57,300 --> 00:04:00,890
Sir, pick me again next time!

50
00:04:00,940 --> 00:04:02,310
All right. I'll pick you.

51
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:03,080
Watch this trick.

52
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:04,030
Leaping onto the horse!

53
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:04,590
Okay.

54
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:08,430
So brave!

55
00:04:24,480 --> 00:04:25,360
Don't go...

56
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:08,430
Aren't you cold?

57
00:05:12,070 --> 00:05:12,800
Let's talk inside.

58
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:14,920
No.

59
00:05:16,310 --> 00:05:18,390
Out here, I can see the moon.

60
00:05:19,070 --> 00:05:21,270
Inside, it's stuffy and dark.

61
00:05:22,430 --> 00:05:23,950
Some people earn
a capital official's salary

62
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,830
but won't even buy a few extra candles.

63
00:05:27,270 --> 00:05:28,190
Next time you come,

64
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:29,160
let me know in advance,

65
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:30,360
and I'll light a few more.

66
00:05:31,750 --> 00:05:34,070
Save your salary for yourself.

67
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:37,430
I should come here less often.

68
00:05:38,270 --> 00:05:39,160
Every visit

69
00:05:39,870 --> 00:05:41,240
brings nothing but trouble and worry.

70
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:46,390
Is it about Zhang Jun?

71
00:05:48,070 --> 00:05:49,190
Fang Tong followed him for days

72
00:05:49,870 --> 00:05:51,160
and dug up some information.

73
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:54,830
Every day,
the brat leaves the Minister's Estate

74
00:05:55,270 --> 00:05:56,680
and heads straight for brothels.

75
00:05:57,430 --> 00:05:59,310
After blowing cash and eating his fill,

76
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,270
he struts through the streets

77
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:03,070
and heads out of town to hunt.

78
00:06:03,390 --> 00:06:04,310
Same routine, day after day.

79
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:07,830
Isn't that how rich brats live?

80
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:10,120
Since he loves hunting,

81
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:11,830
is he any good at it?

82
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:30,800
(Firing three arrows at once?)

83
00:06:37,830 --> 00:06:38,240
Nice shot!

84
00:06:38,290 --> 00:06:39,530
Zhang Cheng, the Minister of Revenue,

85
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:41,360
was nearly sixty when this son was born.

86
00:06:41,410 --> 00:06:42,450
Let's take a look ahead!

87
00:06:42,510 --> 00:06:44,070
He's useless at both books and weapons,

88
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:45,360
a complete fool,

89
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:48,310
yet he's shielded
by his father and grandfather.

90
00:06:49,390 --> 00:06:51,270
His father frequents
Lord Yu's residence,

91
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:52,630
kissing up and currying favor,

92
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:54,240
and Yu Cheng'an thinks highly of him.

93
00:06:55,190 --> 00:06:55,920
This family

94
00:06:56,430 --> 00:06:57,040
can't be brought down

95
00:06:57,090 --> 00:06:58,900
by some low-ranking official

96
00:06:58,950 --> 00:06:59,750
like you.

97
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:01,480
Even I,

98
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:03,270
a princess in name only,

99
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:04,600
can't lay a finger on him.

100
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:07,240
Do I need to do it myself?

101
00:07:08,310 --> 00:07:09,920
Sheng'an is like an arena.

102
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:11,390
Fierce tigers

103
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:13,920
will devour jackals like Zhang Jun.

104
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:23,920
Since he dares to hurt others
in broad daylight,

105
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:26,040
we should return the "favor,"

106
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:27,430
an eye for an eye.

107
00:07:28,310 --> 00:07:30,040
We should let him die in broad daylight,

108
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,600
knowing full well why.

109
00:07:35,190 --> 00:07:36,750
Only one family can be the tiger

110
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:38,560
to take down the Zhangs

111
00:07:39,190 --> 00:07:40,190
in all of Sheng'an.

112
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:48,890
What are you doing?

113
00:07:48,940 --> 00:07:49,740
Know your place?

114
00:07:49,870 --> 00:07:51,270
You dare knock on Lord Yu's back gate?

115
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:52,800
I'm Yan Shang.

116
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:54,360
Mr. Yu Xianyao did me a favor,

117
00:07:54,750 --> 00:07:55,830
so I'm here to thank him in person.

118
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:57,800
Please announce my arrival.

119
00:07:58,390 --> 00:07:59,480
You're here to see him?

120
00:07:59,750 --> 00:08:00,070
Yes.

121
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:01,160
Come with me, then.

122
00:08:02,630 --> 00:08:02,920
All right.

123
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:04,510
Wait, they just let him in?

124
00:08:05,070 --> 00:08:06,210
- How'd he get in?
- We've been waiting ages!

125
00:08:06,260 --> 00:08:06,930
Why does he get to go in?

126
00:08:06,980 --> 00:08:08,150
Why can't we?

127
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:38,320
My savior?

128
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:40,840
My savior?

129
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:50,390
It's you.

130
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:52,440
What brings you here?

131
00:08:54,390 --> 00:08:55,600
Last time at Cuiyun Tower,

132
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:57,120
I didn't have enough money

133
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:57,870
to give you a proper welcome.

134
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,440
I've felt bad about it ever since.

135
00:09:00,390 --> 00:09:02,200
I've just been appointed
and received my first salary.

136
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:05,120
Would you honor me with another chance?

137
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:06,270
We'll eat to our hearts' content.

138
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:07,960
No!

139
00:09:08,510 --> 00:09:08,960
I'm tired of the food there.

140
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:11,120
Well, then...

141
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:14,150
Greetings, Lord Yu.

142
00:09:14,630 --> 00:09:15,000
Father!

143
00:09:19,790 --> 00:09:20,550
Yan Shang.

144
00:09:23,390 --> 00:09:24,960
How do you two know each other?

145
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:26,670
I met him

146
00:09:27,080 --> 00:09:28,200
at Chancellor Liu's residence.

147
00:09:29,030 --> 00:09:29,360
Yes.

148
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:31,480
I happened to meet Mr. Yu Xianyao

149
00:09:31,670 --> 00:09:32,910
at Chancellor Liu's residence.

150
00:09:33,480 --> 00:09:34,270
By a stroke of luck,

151
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:35,550
I had the honor of befriending him.

152
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:39,000
How interesting.

153
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:41,120
You...

154
00:09:42,200 --> 00:09:43,270
really are an interesting man.

155
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:51,390
You're a close ally of Princess Danyang,

156
00:09:52,270 --> 00:09:53,790
and a regular visitor
to Chancellor Liu's.

157
00:09:54,670 --> 00:09:55,480
And now,

158
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:57,630
you've befriended my son.

159
00:09:58,840 --> 00:09:59,600
Everyone says

160
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:02,030
it's hard to get by in Sheng'an.

161
00:10:02,870 --> 00:10:05,440
Yet you seem to manage just fine.

162
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:09,000
You flatter me, Lord Yu.

163
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:10,870
I'm just a commoner.

164
00:10:11,630 --> 00:10:12,360
Without your help,

165
00:10:12,720 --> 00:10:14,360
I'd never have secured this post.

166
00:10:15,200 --> 00:10:17,390
I'd have been lost in Sheng'an,

167
00:10:18,270 --> 00:10:19,480
wasting my days away.

168
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:24,390
Recommending talent to the court

169
00:10:25,030 --> 00:10:27,440
is simply a subject's duty.

170
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:28,720
It's nothing.

171
00:10:32,240 --> 00:10:33,120
Speaking of which,

172
00:10:33,270 --> 00:10:36,690
the imperial exams seek talent
from across the realm,

173
00:10:36,740 --> 00:10:39,380
so the worthy can serve the court.

174
00:10:41,750 --> 00:10:42,600
Tell me,

175
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:45,030
are you a man of talent

176
00:10:48,510 --> 00:10:49,790
or a man of greatness?

177
00:10:54,750 --> 00:10:55,870
Thanks to your support,

178
00:10:56,670 --> 00:10:57,240
I

179
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:59,550
might just qualify

180
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:00,840
as a third-rate talent.

181
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:06,080
You're quite the straight shooter.

182
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:09,150
But hold on.

183
00:11:10,150 --> 00:11:13,510
Aren't you scholars always so lofty,

184
00:11:14,150 --> 00:11:17,150
refusing to mix
with court insiders like me?

185
00:11:19,630 --> 00:11:22,320
A gentleman is indeed dignified.

186
00:11:23,510 --> 00:11:24,670
But for the people's sake,

187
00:11:25,150 --> 00:11:26,480
in times of peace,

188
00:11:27,480 --> 00:11:28,390
I'll follow the virtuous.

189
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:30,750
As for who's on the throne,

190
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:33,030
that hardly matters.

191
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:43,840
Good!

192
00:11:45,150 --> 00:11:45,960
You've studied well,

193
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:48,150
and not just from books.

194
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:50,360
You're nothing like

195
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:52,750
those stuffy, pedantic scholars.

196
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:56,630
To be honest,

197
00:11:58,150 --> 00:11:59,000
my son

198
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:00,840
has no learning to speak of.

199
00:12:04,200 --> 00:12:05,240
This silly boy

200
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:09,390
has relied on my name
to get by at the Investigation Office.

201
00:12:10,150 --> 00:12:11,360
But after all these years,

202
00:12:11,790 --> 00:12:13,840
all he's learned are dirty tricks.

203
00:12:15,270 --> 00:12:16,000
From now on,

204
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:18,200
I hope Scholar Yan

205
00:12:18,670 --> 00:12:19,550
will guide him more.

206
00:12:21,320 --> 00:12:21,960
I wouldn't presume.

207
00:12:22,510 --> 00:12:23,120
At least

208
00:12:23,750 --> 00:12:24,910
teach him some ways

209
00:12:25,550 --> 00:12:28,120
to get things done in the open.

210
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:32,030
Please look after me, Mr. Yan.

211
00:12:33,480 --> 00:12:34,080
I wouldn't presume.

212
00:12:36,320 --> 00:12:36,750
All right.

213
00:12:38,270 --> 00:12:39,320
I know what you're thinking now.

214
00:12:40,270 --> 00:12:40,720
You two should

215
00:12:41,550 --> 00:12:42,030
spend more time together.

216
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:43,630
Take care, Father.

217
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:59,000
You really are an interesting man.

218
00:13:07,150 --> 00:13:08,320
Sorry to trouble you, sir.

219
00:13:09,120 --> 00:13:11,120
A few steps are no trouble at all.

220
00:13:12,910 --> 00:13:14,390
Tomorrow, I'll be turned away again.

221
00:13:14,750 --> 00:13:15,790
That's the real headache.

222
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:19,600
Are you going to visit Chancellor Liu

223
00:13:20,390 --> 00:13:20,790
again tomorrow?

224
00:13:21,720 --> 00:13:23,030
That's no visit.

225
00:13:23,150 --> 00:13:24,150
You don't even get to see him.

226
00:13:26,550 --> 00:13:27,630
You have my sympathy, sir.

227
00:13:28,270 --> 00:13:29,390
Lord Yu must've ordered you to go.

228
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:32,840
That old man doesn't even
attend court anymore.

229
00:13:33,030 --> 00:13:34,150
How much longer can he last?

230
00:13:34,670 --> 00:13:35,690
My father keeps making me

231
00:13:35,740 --> 00:13:37,570
put on this show
of respect for my mentors.

232
00:13:38,270 --> 00:13:39,270
Isn't that just fake?

233
00:13:43,670 --> 00:13:44,390
Do you know why

234
00:13:44,870 --> 00:13:46,840
Chancellor Liu keeps turning you away,

235
00:13:47,550 --> 00:13:48,790
yet your father keeps sending you back?

236
00:13:50,270 --> 00:13:50,840
Why?

237
00:13:51,910 --> 00:13:52,630
Because Chancellor Liu

238
00:13:53,120 --> 00:13:54,270
has never received you.

239
00:13:54,790 --> 00:13:55,360
So what?

240
00:13:55,600 --> 00:13:57,080
Spit it out.

241
00:13:59,870 --> 00:14:00,200
Come here.

242
00:14:04,030 --> 00:14:05,840
Chancellor Liu is the leading scholar
of our time,

243
00:14:06,150 --> 00:14:08,120
a role model to scholars everywhere.

244
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:09,480
Lord Yu respects him,

245
00:14:09,910 --> 00:14:11,870
so he wants you to pay your respects.

246
00:14:12,390 --> 00:14:14,080
It shows your father values
mentors and learning.

247
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:15,670
It's all a show,

248
00:14:16,360 --> 00:14:17,120
a public gesture,

249
00:14:17,840 --> 00:14:19,870
a way to reassure scholars

250
00:14:20,080 --> 00:14:21,550
across the realm.

251
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:23,670
That makes sense.

252
00:14:24,670 --> 00:14:25,150
It does.

253
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:27,720
But if Chancellor Liu won't see you,

254
00:14:28,120 --> 00:14:29,390
the show can't go on.

255
00:14:29,670 --> 00:14:31,120
This "valuing mentors and learning"

256
00:14:31,390 --> 00:14:32,360
can't be claimed.

257
00:14:32,630 --> 00:14:35,080
So you'll keep getting turned away.

258
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:38,720
So if he sees me once,

259
00:14:39,790 --> 00:14:41,440
I won't have to keep going back,

260
00:14:41,630 --> 00:14:42,240
just to get snubbed?

261
00:14:43,960 --> 00:14:44,960
But my father warned me

262
00:14:45,550 --> 00:14:46,550
not to offend that old man.

263
00:14:46,750 --> 00:14:48,870
So I can't exactly drag him out, can I?

264
00:14:50,480 --> 00:14:52,840
Do you know why he won't see you?

265
00:14:53,670 --> 00:14:54,550
He can't stand me.

266
00:14:55,360 --> 00:14:56,510
Not quite.

267
00:14:57,510 --> 00:14:59,030
Everyone knows

268
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:00,840
how things stand at court.

269
00:15:02,150 --> 00:15:03,150
Chancellor Liu is far too shrewd

270
00:15:03,550 --> 00:15:04,440
not to see what's going on.

271
00:15:04,840 --> 00:15:05,360
It's just that,

272
00:15:05,670 --> 00:15:06,910
as the leader of the scholars,

273
00:15:07,320 --> 00:15:07,670
he can't

274
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:09,390
just

275
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:10,440
meet you.

276
00:15:13,240 --> 00:15:13,910
Why not?

277
00:15:16,200 --> 00:15:16,670
Do you

278
00:15:17,480 --> 00:15:18,910
really want to meet him?

279
00:15:19,630 --> 00:15:20,120
I do.

280
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:21,750
I swear on my life.

281
00:15:22,360 --> 00:15:24,030
If I see him just once,

282
00:15:24,390 --> 00:15:26,630
I'll have fulfilled my father's orders,

283
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:28,200
and I'll be free.

284
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:32,240
Why do you ask?

285
00:15:32,630 --> 00:15:33,910
Got a plan?

286
00:15:36,720 --> 00:15:37,550
I do,

287
00:15:38,390 --> 00:15:39,000
but...

288
00:15:39,720 --> 00:15:41,440
I can't guarantee it'll work.

289
00:15:41,670 --> 00:15:43,480
It's worth a try.

290
00:15:44,320 --> 00:15:44,910
Go on.

291
00:15:49,480 --> 00:15:50,480
For this to work,

292
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:51,910
we need

293
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:53,000
the right timing,

294
00:15:53,600 --> 00:15:53,960
the right place,

295
00:15:54,550 --> 00:15:55,120
and the right people.

296
00:15:57,200 --> 00:15:57,960
First, the right people.

297
00:15:58,630 --> 00:16:00,150
You always dress in luxury,

298
00:16:00,360 --> 00:16:01,760
riding a jeweled saddle,

299
00:16:01,810 --> 00:16:02,500
surrounded by servants.

300
00:16:02,910 --> 00:16:03,360
But Chancellor Liu

301
00:16:03,790 --> 00:16:05,910
keeps his distance
from the rich and powerful.

302
00:16:06,510 --> 00:16:07,870
He prefers to help the poor.

303
00:16:08,270 --> 00:16:09,270
Showing up dressed like that,

304
00:16:10,200 --> 00:16:11,510
you're barking up the wrong tree.

305
00:16:14,320 --> 00:16:15,270
Then I'll change.

306
00:16:16,080 --> 00:16:16,480
Exactly.

307
00:16:17,200 --> 00:16:19,120
Put away the silk for now

308
00:16:19,550 --> 00:16:20,790
and change into plain hemp robes.

309
00:16:22,030 --> 00:16:22,750
Have you seen

310
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:24,670
how Imperial Academy students dress?

311
00:16:25,150 --> 00:16:26,910
The more you look like one, the better.

312
00:16:27,870 --> 00:16:29,480
That's how those elder scholars

313
00:16:29,670 --> 00:16:31,000
like to see people dressed.

314
00:16:32,720 --> 00:16:33,030
Got it.

315
00:16:35,320 --> 00:16:35,960
Now, the right place.

316
00:16:37,360 --> 00:16:38,720
However powerful your family is,

317
00:16:39,030 --> 00:16:40,120
once you're at his gate,

318
00:16:40,720 --> 00:16:41,670
you're on his turf.

319
00:16:42,120 --> 00:16:43,390
Whether he sees you

320
00:16:43,720 --> 00:16:44,910
is entirely up to him.

321
00:16:49,720 --> 00:16:50,480
I know.

322
00:16:51,910 --> 00:16:53,840
I can't keep going to his house
just to be snubbed.

323
00:16:54,320 --> 00:16:55,390
I'll have to catch him outside!

324
00:16:55,790 --> 00:16:56,600
Exactly.

325
00:16:57,240 --> 00:16:59,200
You're a genius!

326
00:16:59,600 --> 00:17:00,120
And the right timing?

327
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:01,000
Tell me!

328
00:17:02,600 --> 00:17:03,910
The right timing...

329
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:07,680
Well, if I tell you,

330
00:17:08,200 --> 00:17:09,270
you must keep it to yourself.

331
00:17:09,640 --> 00:17:11,440
Don't tell anyone you heard it from me.

332
00:17:12,160 --> 00:17:12,880
Don't worry.

333
00:17:13,310 --> 00:17:15,790
I'd never betray a friend!

334
00:17:20,830 --> 00:17:22,480
Today, my colleagues said

335
00:17:23,160 --> 00:17:24,030
Chancellor Liu plans

336
00:17:24,510 --> 00:17:27,590
to relax at Huanghua Stream
tomorrow morning.

337
00:17:28,070 --> 00:17:29,790
They're debating
whether to visit him there.

338
00:17:31,070 --> 00:17:32,640
Huanghua Stream...

339
00:17:35,720 --> 00:17:37,240
No gates to keep me out,

340
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:40,310
no walls around the outskirts.

341
00:17:41,680 --> 00:17:42,720
He can't turn me away there!

342
00:17:46,350 --> 00:17:46,880
Tomorrow

343
00:17:47,270 --> 00:17:48,270
is the right time.

344
00:17:48,640 --> 00:17:50,070
Huanghua Stream is the right place.

345
00:17:50,400 --> 00:17:52,000
Mr. Yu, change your clothes,

346
00:17:52,270 --> 00:17:53,070
leave your attendants behind,

347
00:17:53,440 --> 00:17:54,920
and dress
like a scholar out for a stroll.

348
00:17:55,440 --> 00:17:56,070
Once you're close

349
00:17:56,440 --> 00:17:57,110
and Chancellor Liu spots you,

350
00:17:57,640 --> 00:17:58,750
it'll be too late to avoid you.

351
00:17:59,880 --> 00:18:00,480
That way,

352
00:18:01,160 --> 00:18:02,550
you'll have done
your duty to your father,

353
00:18:03,160 --> 00:18:04,240
and you can finally relax.

354
00:18:05,400 --> 00:18:07,160
If Chancellor Liu
doesn't go out tomorrow,

355
00:18:07,750 --> 00:18:09,400
you've only wasted one extra trip.

356
00:18:09,920 --> 00:18:10,350
Just think of it

357
00:18:10,790 --> 00:18:11,350
as a pleasant outing.

358
00:18:13,270 --> 00:18:13,920
Mr. Yan,

359
00:18:14,270 --> 00:18:15,880
you're like a real brother to me!

360
00:18:17,030 --> 00:18:18,270
Think nothing of it.

361
00:18:19,030 --> 00:18:21,750
But my plan's not very certain.

362
00:18:22,030 --> 00:18:22,590
If it doesn't work,

363
00:18:23,160 --> 00:18:24,070
don't hold it against me.

364
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:25,070
Of course not!

365
00:18:25,400 --> 00:18:26,400
I'd thank you before anything else.

366
00:18:26,550 --> 00:18:26,830
Come on.

367
00:18:27,310 --> 00:18:28,440
My treat at Cuiyun Tower today!

368
00:18:28,830 --> 00:18:29,830
- You're too kind.
- Let's go!

369
00:18:33,310 --> 00:18:35,310
Let's find you
some plain hemp robes first.

370
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:36,070
No rush.

371
00:18:37,400 --> 00:18:37,720
(Pingkang Ward Tavern)
(Hurry!)

372
00:18:38,030 --> 00:18:38,400
(Make way!)

373
00:18:38,680 --> 00:18:39,000
(Wangchun Wine)
(Make way!)

374
00:18:39,310 --> 00:18:39,640
(Make way!)

375
00:18:40,200 --> 00:18:40,760
- Make way!
- Hurry!

376
00:18:40,810 --> 00:18:41,330
(What's going on?)

377
00:18:41,380 --> 00:18:42,050
- Make way!
- What's all this?

378
00:18:42,100 --> 00:18:42,380
(Hurry!)

379
00:18:42,430 --> 00:18:43,030
(What's happening?)

380
00:18:43,350 --> 00:18:43,680
(Pingkang Ward)
Oh...

381
00:18:44,830 --> 00:18:45,200
Well...

382
00:18:48,720 --> 00:18:49,160
Sir.

383
00:18:49,720 --> 00:18:50,750
I was blind

384
00:18:50,920 --> 00:18:52,480
and failed to recognize
the honored guest.

385
00:18:53,070 --> 00:18:54,680
Her Highness Princess Danyang is here

386
00:18:55,350 --> 00:18:56,590
to sample your cooking.

387
00:19:02,110 --> 00:19:03,750
So it's Your Highness!

388
00:19:04,310 --> 00:19:05,110
Forgive me!

389
00:19:05,400 --> 00:19:06,110
Please, come right in!

390
00:19:08,310 --> 00:19:10,590
Why are there so many ruffians
in your tavern?

391
00:19:12,960 --> 00:19:13,720
Don't worry.

392
00:19:14,070 --> 00:19:15,400
They're all regulars.

393
00:19:15,680 --> 00:19:16,790
No riffraff here.

394
00:19:17,400 --> 00:19:18,790
How many heads can you bet on that?

395
00:19:19,680 --> 00:19:19,960
I...

396
00:19:20,400 --> 00:19:21,880
I only have one head to lose.

397
00:19:22,400 --> 00:19:23,030
Forgive me, Your Highness.

398
00:19:23,440 --> 00:19:24,640
I'll do whatever you say.

399
00:19:25,160 --> 00:19:26,070
Throw them all out.

400
00:19:26,750 --> 00:19:28,070
Her Highness will cover

401
00:19:28,720 --> 00:19:29,830
the cost of their food.

402
00:19:31,350 --> 00:19:32,640
You have
one incense stick's worth of time.

403
00:19:33,270 --> 00:19:34,480
Get them all out.

404
00:19:35,270 --> 00:19:35,920
Otherwise,

405
00:19:36,310 --> 00:19:37,480
I'll tear this shabby tavern down!

406
00:19:39,270 --> 00:19:39,830
Understood!

407
00:19:43,590 --> 00:19:44,210
Get out!

408
00:19:44,260 --> 00:19:44,900
Stop drinking! Move!

409
00:19:44,950 --> 00:19:45,820
I haven't finished eating!

410
00:19:46,110 --> 00:19:46,450
What's going on?

411
00:19:46,500 --> 00:19:47,220
This place is reserved today!

412
00:19:47,270 --> 00:19:47,810
Get out!

413
00:19:47,860 --> 00:19:48,750
This is outrageous!

414
00:19:55,110 --> 00:19:55,880
What did I tell you?

415
00:19:57,400 --> 00:19:58,720
Go ahead and report me.

416
00:19:59,110 --> 00:20:00,030
What good will that do?

417
00:20:00,720 --> 00:20:03,000
I'm still waiting
for the authorities to arrest me.

418
00:20:04,030 --> 00:20:05,920
Haven't seen a single one of them yet.

419
00:20:08,720 --> 00:20:09,830
Never mind crippling him,

420
00:20:10,240 --> 00:20:12,750
even if I killed him,
what could they do?

421
00:20:14,480 --> 00:20:14,750
Come on.

422
00:20:15,350 --> 00:20:15,750
Fill it up!

423
00:20:15,880 --> 00:20:17,400
(I told you,
the tavern's reserved today.)

424
00:20:17,640 --> 00:20:18,480
(Just go!)

425
00:20:19,200 --> 00:20:20,110
(Stop eating! Get out!)

426
00:20:21,160 --> 00:20:21,830
What's going on?

427
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:23,830
Please calm down, sir.

428
00:20:24,160 --> 00:20:25,880
Princess Danyang suddenly showed up,

429
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:27,680
saying our customers were a rough bunch

430
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:28,880
and ordering us to clear the place.

431
00:20:29,590 --> 00:20:30,070
So, gentlemen...

432
00:20:33,590 --> 00:20:34,270
Sit down.

433
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:35,960
What's all the fuss about?

434
00:20:36,720 --> 00:20:37,270
Listen,

435
00:20:37,590 --> 00:20:38,590
there's a reason

436
00:20:39,110 --> 00:20:40,550
you guys never get anywhere.

437
00:20:42,790 --> 00:20:43,400
Keep eating.

438
00:20:44,030 --> 00:20:46,070
I'll go greet the Princess.

439
00:20:47,960 --> 00:20:48,440
Zhang Jun,

440
00:20:49,110 --> 00:20:50,790
you know Princess Danyang?

441
00:20:50,920 --> 00:20:51,720
Not personally.

442
00:20:52,510 --> 00:20:53,960
And she doesn't know me either.

443
00:20:54,510 --> 00:20:54,880
But

444
00:20:55,400 --> 00:20:56,920
she must know my father.

445
00:20:57,310 --> 00:20:59,960
She can't just brush him off, can she?

446
00:21:13,750 --> 00:21:14,070
Hold it!

447
00:21:15,070 --> 00:21:15,510
Who are you?

448
00:21:17,510 --> 00:21:18,480
How many heads do you have to lose?

449
00:21:18,880 --> 00:21:19,830
How dare you speak to me like that?

450
00:21:20,070 --> 00:21:20,960
When you stopped me,

451
00:21:21,110 --> 00:21:22,400
did you ask your master inside first?

452
00:21:23,480 --> 00:21:24,270
Who's out there?

453
00:21:26,920 --> 00:21:27,310
Your Highness,

454
00:21:27,750 --> 00:21:28,440
I'm Zhang Jun.

455
00:21:29,200 --> 00:21:30,310
Zhang Jun? Who's that?

456
00:21:31,750 --> 00:21:33,350
My father is Zhang Cheng,
the Minister of Revenue...

457
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:48,510
Ah, Mr. Zhang.

458
00:21:49,920 --> 00:21:51,270
Your name rang a bell,

459
00:21:51,550 --> 00:21:52,440
but I couldn't quite place it.

460
00:21:54,480 --> 00:21:55,160
Greetings, Your Highness.

461
00:21:56,510 --> 00:21:57,160
What do you want?

462
00:21:58,310 --> 00:21:59,200
Nothing much.

463
00:21:59,440 --> 00:22:02,030
I was drinking with friends next door

464
00:22:02,310 --> 00:22:03,680
when the owner was kicking us out.

465
00:22:04,000 --> 00:22:04,310
So,

466
00:22:04,680 --> 00:22:07,030
I'd shamelessly ask a favor
of Your Highness.

467
00:22:07,640 --> 00:22:09,110
What's there to ask?

468
00:22:10,070 --> 00:22:12,480
I'm only kicking out the riffraff.

469
00:22:12,960 --> 00:22:13,640
Surely

470
00:22:13,790 --> 00:22:15,790
I wouldn't kick out Mr. Zhang.

471
00:22:17,830 --> 00:22:18,510
Thank you, Your Highness.

472
00:22:19,510 --> 00:22:20,970
If there's nothing else,

473
00:22:21,020 --> 00:22:21,980
I'll take my leave.

474
00:22:22,070 --> 00:22:22,550
I'll be going.

475
00:22:23,310 --> 00:22:23,750
Wait.

476
00:22:24,750 --> 00:22:25,550
Drinking alone is no fun.

477
00:22:26,110 --> 00:22:28,160
Why not stay, Mr. Zhang?

478
00:22:28,880 --> 00:22:29,720
Join me here.

479
00:22:30,200 --> 00:22:31,070
We'll have a drink together.

480
00:22:31,640 --> 00:22:32,110
What do you say?

481
00:22:32,680 --> 00:22:33,070
Your Highness...

482
00:22:33,550 --> 00:22:33,830
Well...

483
00:22:34,680 --> 00:22:34,920
I...

484
00:22:36,160 --> 00:22:38,030
You're too kind!

485
00:22:40,160 --> 00:22:40,680
Fang Tong,

486
00:22:41,480 --> 00:22:43,750
lay an extra place for Mr. Zhang.

487
00:22:43,960 --> 00:22:44,270
Got it.

488
00:22:45,440 --> 00:22:46,440
Your Highness, one moment.

489
00:22:48,030 --> 00:22:49,440
Hey, you!

490
00:22:50,440 --> 00:22:52,000
Tell them

491
00:22:52,440 --> 00:22:52,960
that I

492
00:22:53,440 --> 00:22:54,350
and Her Highness

493
00:22:54,750 --> 00:22:55,880
hit it off the moment we met.

494
00:22:56,550 --> 00:22:57,640
So I won't join them.

495
00:22:58,160 --> 00:22:58,830
Let them

496
00:22:59,240 --> 00:23:00,400
put it on my tab.

497
00:23:00,590 --> 00:23:01,110
Got it?

498
00:23:02,510 --> 00:23:02,790
Yes, sir.

499
00:23:03,720 --> 00:23:04,000
Go on.

500
00:23:18,440 --> 00:23:19,170
Beautifully written!

501
00:23:19,220 --> 00:23:19,900
Exactly!

502
00:23:25,550 --> 00:23:26,440
(Move! Move!)

503
00:23:36,350 --> 00:23:36,750
That one.

504
00:23:37,240 --> 00:23:37,750
Grab him!

505
00:23:39,960 --> 00:23:40,440
What are you doing?

506
00:23:41,590 --> 00:23:41,850
Don't move!

507
00:23:41,900 --> 00:23:42,500
Who are you people?

508
00:23:42,790 --> 00:23:43,830
This is the Imperial Academy!

509
00:23:44,200 --> 00:23:44,450
Don't move!

510
00:23:44,500 --> 00:23:45,050
Let go of me!

511
00:23:48,000 --> 00:23:48,510
What are you doing?

512
00:23:54,200 --> 00:23:55,070
Looks about right.

513
00:23:55,240 --> 00:23:55,960
What do you mean?

514
00:23:56,270 --> 00:23:56,680
Take his clothes off.

515
00:23:57,000 --> 00:23:57,680
Got it!

516
00:23:58,270 --> 00:23:59,270
Strip him down!

517
00:23:59,790 --> 00:24:01,240
His robe, trousers,

518
00:24:01,550 --> 00:24:02,110
and shoes.

519
00:24:02,480 --> 00:24:03,410
Everything!

520
00:24:03,460 --> 00:24:04,220
Let me go!

521
00:24:04,720 --> 00:24:05,070
Let go!

522
00:24:06,720 --> 00:24:07,130
How is it?

523
00:24:07,180 --> 00:24:07,770
(Why's he stripping that man?)

524
00:24:07,820 --> 00:24:08,620
Do I have the air?

525
00:24:08,670 --> 00:24:09,140
(Who knows?)

526
00:24:10,110 --> 00:24:12,590
(Gathering Auspice)
Now that's an impressive presence!

527
00:24:13,440 --> 00:24:14,480
Am I not always impressive?

528
00:24:15,750 --> 00:24:16,680
Oh, look at me.

529
00:24:17,030 --> 00:24:19,160
Of course you are!

530
00:24:19,880 --> 00:24:20,550
You mean to ask

531
00:24:21,480 --> 00:24:22,270
what kind of air?

532
00:24:23,000 --> 00:24:23,680
Well,

533
00:24:24,510 --> 00:24:25,480
the scholarly sort,

534
00:24:25,640 --> 00:24:27,640
like those poor students.

535
00:24:27,920 --> 00:24:28,210
Do I have it?

536
00:24:28,260 --> 00:24:28,700
How could you say that?

537
00:24:28,750 --> 00:24:29,710
Who are you talking about?

538
00:24:31,480 --> 00:24:32,850
You do!

539
00:24:32,900 --> 00:24:34,050
(Gathering Auspice)
Absolutely!

540
00:24:35,550 --> 00:24:36,210
Definitely!

541
00:24:36,260 --> 00:24:36,610
Yes!

542
00:24:37,200 --> 00:24:37,720
Careful, sir.

543
00:24:38,070 --> 00:24:38,550
Careful.

544
00:24:41,750 --> 00:24:43,270
What a show-off.

545
00:24:43,510 --> 00:24:46,200
Stay away from that man. Remember that.

546
00:24:49,750 --> 00:24:50,070
Drink up!

547
00:24:51,480 --> 00:24:52,400
I never knew

548
00:24:52,880 --> 00:24:54,440
you could hold your liquor so well.

549
00:24:55,590 --> 00:24:56,960
I didn't know this before,

550
00:24:57,160 --> 00:24:58,910
but among Sheng'an's women,

551
00:24:58,960 --> 00:24:59,350
no one

552
00:24:59,720 --> 00:25:01,590
is bolder than Your Highness!

553
00:25:08,030 --> 00:25:09,070
I hardly ever

554
00:25:09,200 --> 00:25:10,790
leave the palace.

555
00:25:11,590 --> 00:25:12,960
So, have you heard

556
00:25:14,350 --> 00:25:15,680
any news in Sheng'an?

557
00:25:17,350 --> 00:25:17,750
Your Highness,

558
00:25:18,350 --> 00:25:20,030
now you're putting me on the spot.

559
00:25:20,400 --> 00:25:21,680
I usually stay home all day,

560
00:25:22,070 --> 00:25:24,130
studying or practicing martial arts,

561
00:25:24,180 --> 00:25:25,770
never setting foot outside.

562
00:25:26,000 --> 00:25:27,030
So I haven't heard anything.

563
00:25:30,110 --> 00:25:30,590
Fang Tong,

564
00:25:31,200 --> 00:25:32,440
have you heard anything?

565
00:25:33,110 --> 00:25:34,400
Tell us.

566
00:25:34,830 --> 00:25:35,200
Go on.

567
00:25:37,510 --> 00:25:38,070
Your Highness,

568
00:25:39,030 --> 00:25:39,790
lately,

569
00:25:40,440 --> 00:25:41,830
something unusual has happened.

570
00:25:42,160 --> 00:25:43,790
Word has it

571
00:25:44,830 --> 00:25:46,550
an auspicious sign has appeared

572
00:25:47,440 --> 00:25:48,200
at Huanghua Stream.

573
00:25:49,070 --> 00:25:49,920
What sign?

574
00:25:50,200 --> 00:25:53,030
Someone saw it recently:

575
00:25:53,510 --> 00:25:54,680
a white pheasant appears

576
00:25:55,110 --> 00:25:56,110
every morning

577
00:25:56,750 --> 00:25:57,830
by Huanghua Stream.

578
00:25:58,720 --> 00:25:59,270
That pheasant

579
00:25:59,790 --> 00:26:00,790
is pure white.

580
00:26:02,550 --> 00:26:03,790
What a wonderful omen!

581
00:26:06,640 --> 00:26:08,790
Wait... Huanghua Stream?

582
00:26:09,590 --> 00:26:10,750
I hunt there all the time!

583
00:26:11,960 --> 00:26:13,030
Where exactly along the stream?

584
00:26:14,960 --> 00:26:17,720
They say upstream,

585
00:26:18,680 --> 00:26:19,920
there's a thatched pavilion.

586
00:26:20,550 --> 00:26:21,400
The white pheasant

587
00:26:21,750 --> 00:26:24,200
often appears near it.

588
00:26:28,070 --> 00:26:29,240
What a pity.

589
00:26:30,830 --> 00:26:32,110
I'm just a weak woman,

590
00:26:32,960 --> 00:26:34,510
unable to hunt.

591
00:26:35,110 --> 00:26:37,680
The omen's at my door,
and I can't catch it.

592
00:26:39,750 --> 00:26:40,550
What a shame.

593
00:26:43,350 --> 00:26:44,200
Anything else?

594
00:26:45,480 --> 00:26:45,790
Yes.

595
00:26:46,960 --> 00:26:49,000
Cuiyun Tower

596
00:26:49,350 --> 00:26:51,000
has a new batch

597
00:26:51,640 --> 00:26:53,570
- of foreign dancing girls...
- (A white pheasant at Huanghua Stream.)

598
00:26:54,030 --> 00:26:55,350
(If I hunt it myself)

599
00:26:55,880 --> 00:26:56,880
(and take its tail feathers,)

600
00:26:57,200 --> 00:26:58,640
(then have Father present them
to Lord Yu...)

601
00:26:59,350 --> 00:27:00,680
They can even play the pipa?

602
00:27:01,590 --> 00:27:03,790
And sing and dance,

603
00:27:03,920 --> 00:27:04,310
too.

604
00:27:07,640 --> 00:27:08,880
Come on!

605
00:27:09,830 --> 00:27:11,000
Pour Mr. Zhang some wine.

606
00:27:12,160 --> 00:27:12,550
Thank you.

607
00:27:12,920 --> 00:27:14,680
Forgive my rudeness at the door earlier.

608
00:27:16,480 --> 00:27:16,920
Here, Your Highness.

609
00:27:24,180 --> 00:27:24,620
(Wangchun Wine)

610
00:27:32,640 --> 00:27:33,070
Fang Tong.

611
00:27:33,400 --> 00:27:34,240
What is it, Your Highness?

612
00:27:34,590 --> 00:27:35,590
Go find Yang Si.

613
00:27:36,550 --> 00:27:38,750
Ask if he'd like to join me tomorrow

614
00:27:39,400 --> 00:27:41,110
for an outing beyond the city.

615
00:27:41,510 --> 00:27:41,830
Understood.

616
00:28:11,260 --> 00:28:15,900
(Huanghua Stream)

617
00:28:18,070 --> 00:28:19,000
Sir, we're here.

618
00:28:34,750 --> 00:28:35,590
You can stay here.

619
00:28:36,480 --> 00:28:38,160
The old man hates
seeing you crowd around me.

620
00:28:38,550 --> 00:28:39,720
Looks like
we're throwing our weight around.

621
00:28:40,550 --> 00:28:41,640
Understood.

622
00:28:48,920 --> 00:28:50,110
Go see if I hit anything.

623
00:28:51,570 --> 00:28:52,330
Ah.

624
00:28:54,400 --> 00:28:54,880
Sir!

625
00:28:55,510 --> 00:28:56,350
It's a wild rabbit.

626
00:28:56,550 --> 00:28:56,920
It got away.

627
00:28:57,070 --> 00:28:57,590
A wild rabbit?

628
00:28:58,880 --> 00:29:01,070
Not worth wasting an arrow on!

629
00:29:01,510 --> 00:29:02,480
Come on, let's head up.

630
00:29:38,480 --> 00:29:39,070
Yan Shang.

631
00:29:39,590 --> 00:29:40,440
What are you looking at?

632
00:29:42,510 --> 00:29:43,480
The light is perfect.

633
00:29:43,830 --> 00:29:44,480
I'd say

634
00:29:45,200 --> 00:29:46,590
it's a fine day for hunting.

635
00:29:47,310 --> 00:29:48,110
You know how to hunt?

636
00:29:50,920 --> 00:29:51,270
No.

637
00:29:57,350 --> 00:29:57,880
(Huanghua Stream)
Your Highness.

638
00:29:58,480 --> 00:29:58,960
Got it.

639
00:29:59,510 --> 00:30:01,070
That brat's been firing arrows
the whole way.

640
00:30:05,310 --> 00:30:06,960
I'm running around
taking care of everything,

641
00:30:07,680 --> 00:30:09,720
while he sits comfortably
at Hongwen Hall,

642
00:30:11,000 --> 00:30:11,830
without a care in the world.

643
00:30:13,270 --> 00:30:14,000
Tell me about it.

644
00:30:21,110 --> 00:30:23,920
Yan Shang laid the bait perfectly.

645
00:30:24,640 --> 00:30:24,960
Let me do it.

646
00:30:30,750 --> 00:30:32,400
A son pays for his father's sins.

647
00:30:33,070 --> 00:30:35,640
Even killing you a hundred times
wouldn't be enough.

648
00:30:46,030 --> 00:30:47,270
My backside!

649
00:30:51,270 --> 00:30:52,970
Where'd that white pheasant go?

650
00:30:53,020 --> 00:30:54,740
White pheasant, where are you?

651
00:30:56,200 --> 00:30:56,480
Give one to me.

652
00:31:16,480 --> 00:31:17,000
Something's moving.

653
00:31:17,640 --> 00:31:18,110
Go check it out.

654
00:31:18,350 --> 00:31:18,640
Yes, sir.

655
00:31:26,550 --> 00:31:28,070
Sir, something's happened!

656
00:31:29,480 --> 00:31:30,090
Look at you!

657
00:31:31,590 --> 00:31:32,400
What happened?

658
00:31:32,960 --> 00:31:34,030
All that yelling and screaming.

659
00:31:34,550 --> 00:31:35,960
No wonder
you'll never amount to anything.

660
00:31:36,030 --> 00:31:37,400
Looks like... you hit someone.

661
00:31:43,400 --> 00:31:44,640
Wh-Why the panic?

662
00:31:46,030 --> 00:31:46,310
You,

663
00:31:47,790 --> 00:31:49,480
see if he's still breathing.

664
00:31:54,310 --> 00:31:55,400
Sir, he's not dead.

665
00:31:55,480 --> 00:31:56,400
H-he's still breathing.

666
00:32:00,720 --> 00:32:01,400
Then make sure he stops.

667
00:32:02,640 --> 00:32:04,240
Sir, he's still alive.

668
00:32:04,550 --> 00:32:06,960
(So young, yet so vicious.)

669
00:32:07,830 --> 00:32:09,830
(No wonder Her Highness told me
to keep an eye here.)

670
00:32:10,270 --> 00:32:10,750
What are you waiting for?

671
00:32:13,200 --> 00:32:14,070
If he wakes up, will you look after him?

672
00:32:15,750 --> 00:32:16,400
Listen,

673
00:32:17,110 --> 00:32:17,440
once...

674
00:32:18,750 --> 00:32:20,880
once he finds out I shot him,

675
00:32:21,110 --> 00:32:22,200
he'll report me to the authorities.

676
00:32:22,550 --> 00:32:23,000
And that'll

677
00:32:23,050 --> 00:32:24,420
get my father into serious trouble.

678
00:32:24,790 --> 00:32:25,030
Then I...

679
00:32:27,750 --> 00:32:28,160
Hurry up!

680
00:32:28,790 --> 00:32:29,400
Dig a hole and bury him.

681
00:32:30,200 --> 00:32:30,550
Yes, sir.

682
00:32:36,750 --> 00:32:38,350
Wanyao, have you been waiting long?

683
00:32:39,240 --> 00:32:39,880
No.

684
00:32:40,750 --> 00:32:41,680
I was just enjoying the scenery.

685
00:32:42,110 --> 00:32:42,720
It's so peaceful here.

686
00:32:42,920 --> 00:32:43,880
That mouth of yours,

687
00:32:44,030 --> 00:32:46,000
never a nice word since you were a kid.

688
00:32:46,590 --> 00:32:47,510
Good thing I'm used to it.

689
00:32:48,400 --> 00:32:48,720
Let's go.

690
00:32:49,400 --> 00:32:50,070
Let's wait for Fang Tong.

691
00:32:50,790 --> 00:32:51,680
He's checking the path ahead.

692
00:32:52,480 --> 00:32:53,070
He'll be back soon.

693
00:32:53,790 --> 00:32:54,510
He's coming back with us?

694
00:32:55,480 --> 00:32:56,510
Join us or head back.

695
00:32:57,110 --> 00:32:58,070
I'd like to join you.

696
00:33:00,510 --> 00:33:02,680
Last time we went out of town together,
we were kids.

697
00:33:03,400 --> 00:33:04,000
I remember

698
00:33:05,030 --> 00:33:05,790
you kept trying

699
00:33:05,920 --> 00:33:06,750
to shoot me in the backside.

700
00:33:10,030 --> 00:33:10,960
Enough chatter.

701
00:33:11,640 --> 00:33:12,720
Why don't you get back?

702
00:33:15,160 --> 00:33:15,550
Your Highness.

703
00:33:17,480 --> 00:33:17,920
Well?

704
00:33:18,680 --> 00:33:19,960
Found anywhere scenic?

705
00:33:20,070 --> 00:33:21,720
There's a reed marsh at Huanghua Stream.

706
00:33:22,030 --> 00:33:22,680
The scenery

707
00:33:24,110 --> 00:33:24,480
is lovely.

708
00:33:25,720 --> 00:33:26,240
Let's go.

709
00:33:38,790 --> 00:33:39,110
Wait.

710
00:33:40,830 --> 00:33:41,480
Someone's over there.

711
00:33:48,400 --> 00:33:49,130
Hurry up!

712
00:33:49,180 --> 00:33:49,810
Honestly!

713
00:33:49,860 --> 00:33:51,100
It took you forever to dig a hole.

714
00:33:51,310 --> 00:33:52,440
And now you can't even bury him quickly?

715
00:33:53,750 --> 00:33:54,920
Look at the time!

716
00:33:55,200 --> 00:33:57,160
Any later,
and my father will come looking for me.

717
00:33:58,350 --> 00:34:00,720
That's the son
of Zhang Cheng, Minister of Revenue.

718
00:34:00,770 --> 00:34:01,700
Hurry up and bury him!

719
00:34:01,750 --> 00:34:02,380
What's going on here?

720
00:34:02,430 --> 00:34:03,340
Even the horse is getting impatient.

721
00:34:06,880 --> 00:34:08,670
Come on, where's that energy you have
when you're eating?

722
00:34:12,550 --> 00:34:13,710
Is this murder?

723
00:34:14,960 --> 00:34:15,550
Let's go.

724
00:34:15,840 --> 00:34:16,510
We shouldn't get involved.

725
00:34:16,670 --> 00:34:17,000
No.

726
00:34:17,190 --> 00:34:18,840
Wanyao, have Fang Tong take you back.

727
00:34:19,110 --> 00:34:19,760
I have to save him.

728
00:34:20,070 --> 00:34:21,360
Be careful, then.
Don't do anything reckless.

729
00:34:22,550 --> 00:34:23,110
Don't worry.

730
00:34:24,550 --> 00:34:25,670
Whatever happens today,

731
00:34:25,880 --> 00:34:26,590
I'll take full responsibility.

732
00:34:26,960 --> 00:34:28,280
You won't be dragged into this.

733
00:34:29,400 --> 00:34:31,000
I'll pretend you were never here.

734
00:34:39,880 --> 00:34:40,440
Bury him!

735
00:34:40,760 --> 00:34:41,710
Put your backs into it!

736
00:34:41,960 --> 00:34:42,960
You can't even manage

737
00:34:43,070 --> 00:34:44,760
digging a hole and burying a man!

738
00:34:44,840 --> 00:34:46,230
I'm Assessor Yang Si
at the Court of Judicial Review!

739
00:34:46,670 --> 00:34:47,730
Who dares harm a life here?

740
00:34:47,780 --> 00:34:48,650
Go! Run!

741
00:34:49,710 --> 00:34:50,290
Go!

742
00:34:50,340 --> 00:34:50,730
Run!

743
00:34:53,230 --> 00:34:54,360
I thought they'd put up a fight.

744
00:34:54,440 --> 00:34:55,280
But they just ran.

745
00:34:57,590 --> 00:34:58,760
I should've let Wanyao stay.

746
00:34:59,550 --> 00:35:00,510
She would've loved the show.

747
00:35:26,140 --> 00:35:28,180
(Interrogation Chamber,
Court of Judicial Review)

748
00:35:38,670 --> 00:35:39,000
You...

749
00:35:39,800 --> 00:35:40,190
Who...

750
00:35:41,150 --> 00:35:41,710
Who are you?

751
00:35:43,110 --> 00:35:43,920
Where am I?

752
00:35:45,150 --> 00:35:46,150
This is the Court of Judicial Review.

753
00:35:47,280 --> 00:35:48,280
I'm Yang Si, an assessor here.

754
00:35:49,070 --> 00:35:50,230
You were hit by a stray arrow.

755
00:35:52,150 --> 00:35:52,510
It hurts...

756
00:35:53,150 --> 00:35:53,760
It hurts like hell!

757
00:35:54,630 --> 00:35:55,510
Who's the blind fool?

758
00:35:55,920 --> 00:35:57,230
I'll make them pay!

759
00:35:57,800 --> 00:35:58,070
Ow!

760
00:35:58,710 --> 00:35:59,440
What are you doing?

761
00:36:00,110 --> 00:36:01,480
Who's this quack?

762
00:36:02,280 --> 00:36:03,280
We don't have physicians here.

763
00:36:04,550 --> 00:36:05,190
He's the coroner.

764
00:36:05,360 --> 00:36:05,710
What?

765
00:36:06,510 --> 00:36:07,480
Your backside won't stop bleeding.

766
00:36:07,800 --> 00:36:08,360
Put some medicine on it.

767
00:36:15,190 --> 00:36:17,320
(General of Tiger Might is here!)

768
00:36:17,880 --> 00:36:18,590
General of Tiger Might.

769
00:36:21,150 --> 00:36:21,880
This is the Court of Judicial Review.

770
00:36:42,190 --> 00:36:43,800
(Lord Yu is here!)

771
00:36:56,280 --> 00:36:57,840
I'm Yang Si, an assessor
at the Court of Judicial Review.

772
00:37:06,360 --> 00:37:07,230
No serious harm.

773
00:37:08,920 --> 00:37:09,710
Thank you, Imperial Physician Gao.

774
00:37:10,000 --> 00:37:10,920
I'll take my leave.

775
00:37:11,440 --> 00:37:12,110
I'll bid you farewell here.

776
00:37:21,400 --> 00:37:23,150
You said just now you were...

777
00:37:25,360 --> 00:37:27,760
I'm Yang Si, an assessor
at the Court of Judicial Review.

778
00:37:29,280 --> 00:37:29,710
Go on.

779
00:37:32,840 --> 00:37:33,480
Rest assured, Lord Yu.

780
00:37:34,000 --> 00:37:34,880
This case is straightforward.

781
00:37:36,760 --> 00:37:37,670
As you can see,

782
00:37:38,670 --> 00:37:40,150
there's dirt in his ears and nose.

783
00:37:41,000 --> 00:37:42,190
When I found your son,

784
00:37:42,880 --> 00:37:44,320
some people
were trying to bury him alive.

785
00:37:44,590 --> 00:37:45,070
Where are they?

786
00:37:48,280 --> 00:37:48,880
I failed you.

787
00:37:49,840 --> 00:37:50,710
I couldn't capture them alive.

788
00:37:52,280 --> 00:37:52,670
However,

789
00:37:53,280 --> 00:37:54,800
I've removed the arrow left in your son

790
00:37:55,320 --> 00:37:56,110
by the culprit.

791
00:37:56,440 --> 00:37:57,000
It's evidence.

792
00:37:57,590 --> 00:37:57,960
Here, my lord.

793
00:38:02,800 --> 00:38:03,630
From what I can tell,

794
00:38:04,360 --> 00:38:05,440
someone was out hunting,

795
00:38:05,960 --> 00:38:07,000
and his arrow struck your son.

796
00:38:08,480 --> 00:38:09,510
It was more likely an accident

797
00:38:09,590 --> 00:38:10,670
than a deliberate attack.

798
00:38:11,800 --> 00:38:13,480
Whether it was an accident or not,

799
00:38:13,840 --> 00:38:15,000
we haven't reached a verdict yet.

800
00:38:19,030 --> 00:38:19,590
Go on.

801
00:38:23,190 --> 00:38:24,230
He's a madman.

802
00:38:24,920 --> 00:38:26,550
He was burying your son alive,

803
00:38:28,150 --> 00:38:29,590
trying to cover his tracks.

804
00:38:31,590 --> 00:38:32,550
You said

805
00:38:34,070 --> 00:38:36,150
someone saw that culprit

806
00:38:38,800 --> 00:38:40,190
trying to bury Xianyao alive.

807
00:38:41,150 --> 00:38:41,800
Did the witness

808
00:38:42,360 --> 00:38:44,320
get a good look at his face?

809
00:38:46,550 --> 00:38:47,150
I did.

810
00:38:49,630 --> 00:38:50,280
I saw him.

811
00:38:50,670 --> 00:38:52,550
It was Zhang Jun,
son of Zhang Cheng, Minister of Revenue.

812
00:38:53,400 --> 00:38:54,070
I've sent men to arrest him.

813
00:38:56,070 --> 00:38:56,840
I'll leave it to you, General Qiu.

814
00:38:58,030 --> 00:38:58,320
Understood.

815
00:39:03,400 --> 00:39:03,920
This matter

816
00:39:04,440 --> 00:39:05,760
is no longer your concern.

817
00:39:26,150 --> 00:39:26,630
Thank you.

818
00:39:27,280 --> 00:39:27,800
Thank you.

819
00:39:30,500 --> 00:39:34,180
(Zhang Cheng, Minister of Revenue)

820
00:39:34,230 --> 00:39:36,360
(Yintaimen Investigation Office)
Is my son here?

821
00:39:51,030 --> 00:39:51,590
Lord Yu.

822
00:39:52,840 --> 00:39:53,630
My lord above,

823
00:39:54,150 --> 00:39:55,550
I failed to discipline my son.

824
00:39:56,000 --> 00:39:57,190
I deserve to die for it.

825
00:39:58,000 --> 00:39:59,070
When that brat comes out,

826
00:39:59,590 --> 00:40:01,190
I'll break his legs!

827
00:40:06,150 --> 00:40:06,590
There's no need.

828
00:40:07,230 --> 00:40:07,550
No.

829
00:40:08,030 --> 00:40:08,480
There is.

830
00:40:08,760 --> 00:40:09,360
There is.

831
00:40:10,440 --> 00:40:11,030
Minister Zhang...

832
00:40:14,440 --> 00:40:15,230
Yintaimen

833
00:40:16,880 --> 00:40:18,710
has confirmed

834
00:40:19,030 --> 00:40:20,030
that your son

835
00:40:21,960 --> 00:40:24,400
accidentally shot Yu Xianyao

836
00:40:26,150 --> 00:40:27,710
while hunting.

837
00:40:29,000 --> 00:40:29,880
No intent to harm him.

838
00:40:33,110 --> 00:40:33,760
However,

839
00:40:35,510 --> 00:40:39,110
after finding the injured Yu Xianyao,

840
00:40:39,880 --> 00:40:41,670
he didn't get him help,

841
00:40:43,150 --> 00:40:45,400
but tried to bury him alive

842
00:40:46,320 --> 00:40:47,630
to cover his tracks.

843
00:40:48,230 --> 00:40:49,640
Under the law, he should...

844
00:40:49,690 --> 00:40:50,730
Lord Yu!

845
00:40:51,800 --> 00:40:53,480
My son is young and foolish.

846
00:40:53,590 --> 00:40:54,550
He acted recklessly

847
00:40:54,880 --> 00:40:56,360
and caused this terrible mess.

848
00:40:57,440 --> 00:40:58,190
Lord Yu,

849
00:40:58,670 --> 00:41:00,840
please be merciful and spare him.

850
00:41:01,510 --> 00:41:03,280
I have some modest wealth.

851
00:41:03,480 --> 00:41:04,880
I'm willing to give it all up.

852
00:41:05,320 --> 00:41:07,110
Please show mercy!

853
00:41:24,760 --> 00:41:25,440
Minister Zhang,

854
00:41:26,280 --> 00:41:26,960
please get up.

855
00:41:29,440 --> 00:41:29,960
Lord Yu...

856
00:41:30,280 --> 00:41:30,760
Minister Zhang.

857
00:41:32,760 --> 00:41:34,150
Minister Zhang!

858
00:41:37,590 --> 00:41:38,880
I'm a eunuch.

859
00:41:41,190 --> 00:41:42,710
I'm a eunuch!

860
00:41:45,070 --> 00:41:46,400
I have no children of my own.

861
00:41:47,960 --> 00:41:50,760
For over ten years,
through every hardship,

862
00:41:51,630 --> 00:41:54,670
I raised my adopted son to adulthood.

863
00:41:56,320 --> 00:41:57,320
Even I,

864
00:41:58,400 --> 00:42:02,280
the "treacherous eunuch"
you all call me,

865
00:42:03,630 --> 00:42:05,110
know a child must be taught

866
00:42:05,920 --> 00:42:07,360
to obey the law and the rites,

867
00:42:08,150 --> 00:42:09,760
to cultivate virtue!

868
00:42:11,000 --> 00:42:12,440
Don't you?

869
00:42:13,110 --> 00:42:13,440
I...

870
00:42:14,190 --> 00:42:15,590
You old scumbag!

871
00:42:15,920 --> 00:42:17,360
You vile beast!

872
00:42:17,880 --> 00:42:18,150
You...

873
00:42:20,110 --> 00:42:21,630
You're a bandit!

874
00:42:26,960 --> 00:42:27,800
Lord Yu...

875
00:42:29,590 --> 00:42:30,000
Lord Yu...

876
00:42:33,880 --> 00:42:34,280
Lord Yu...

877
00:42:35,440 --> 00:42:36,110
Lord Yu!

878
00:42:36,880 --> 00:42:38,230
My son is ignorant

879
00:42:38,550 --> 00:42:40,150
and has offended your son.

880
00:42:40,550 --> 00:42:42,760
He deserves to die.

881
00:42:43,710 --> 00:42:46,330
But I'm nearly seventy,

882
00:42:46,380 --> 00:42:48,170
and he's my only son.

883
00:42:48,840 --> 00:42:50,760
If anything happens to him,

884
00:42:51,280 --> 00:42:54,230
I won't be able to go on either.

885
00:42:55,800 --> 00:42:56,320
Lord Yu!

886
00:42:57,150 --> 00:42:57,710
Please,

887
00:42:58,150 --> 00:43:00,280
let me take the blame for my son.

888
00:43:00,550 --> 00:43:02,000
Please spare his life!

889
00:43:03,030 --> 00:43:03,630
Lord Yu!

890
00:43:04,230 --> 00:43:05,880
I beg you, Lord Yu!

891
00:43:06,110 --> 00:43:09,440
Lord Yu, have mercy!

892
00:43:11,320 --> 00:43:11,800
Lord Yu!

893
00:43:13,320 --> 00:43:14,800
Spare his life!

894
00:43:16,760 --> 00:43:17,360
Minister Zhang,

895
00:43:19,230 --> 00:43:20,510
you're being foolish.

896
00:43:22,630 --> 00:43:24,480
How dare anyone interfere

897
00:43:25,000 --> 00:43:26,400
with Yintaimen's punishment?

898
00:43:28,030 --> 00:43:28,590
Lord Yu!

899
00:43:29,070 --> 00:43:29,800
Lord Yu!

900
00:43:30,630 --> 00:43:31,150
Lord Yu!

901
00:43:32,550 --> 00:43:34,030
Please show mercy!

902
00:43:34,440 --> 00:43:35,840
Spare his life!

903
00:43:36,590 --> 00:43:37,510
Lord Yu!

904
00:43:38,030 --> 00:43:41,280
Lord Yu, please have mercy!

905
00:43:50,150 --> 00:43:52,110
Tonight, prepare me
some roast camel hump.

906
00:43:53,110 --> 00:43:54,030
Make it

907
00:43:54,590 --> 00:43:55,400
a little crispy.

908
00:43:56,070 --> 00:43:58,150
And prepare some chicken rump.

909
00:43:58,760 --> 00:43:59,480
Make sure

910
00:43:59,670 --> 00:44:00,400
it's nice and fatty.

911
00:44:01,110 --> 00:44:02,070
I need to restore my health.

912
00:44:02,710 --> 00:44:03,190
Understood?

913
00:44:03,400 --> 00:44:04,110
- Got it.
- Got it.

914
00:44:08,970 --> 00:44:10,730
Ow!

915
00:44:10,780 --> 00:44:15,130
My backside hurts!

916
00:44:15,180 --> 00:44:16,350
How is he today?

917
00:44:16,510 --> 00:44:17,110
- It hurts...
- My lord.

918
00:44:17,400 --> 00:44:18,880
The imperial physician said he's fine.

919
00:44:27,630 --> 00:44:30,070
My backside...

920
00:44:30,320 --> 00:44:33,110
It hurts so much...

921
00:44:33,800 --> 00:44:35,840
My backside...

922
00:44:37,880 --> 00:44:38,440
Enough.

923
00:44:39,150 --> 00:44:40,030
Does it really hurt that much?

924
00:44:40,630 --> 00:44:41,190
Father!

925
00:44:41,800 --> 00:44:42,880
It hurts so much!

926
00:44:43,150 --> 00:44:44,590
I nearly got shot dead!

927
00:44:44,960 --> 00:44:45,710
Of course it hurts!

928
00:44:45,840 --> 00:44:47,000
I was scared out of my wits!

929
00:44:48,840 --> 00:44:50,190
Now you know what pain feels like.

930
00:44:50,880 --> 00:44:51,800
What have I always taught you?

931
00:44:52,360 --> 00:44:53,880
A man of wealth
shouldn't put himself at risk.

932
00:44:54,360 --> 00:44:56,000
Why wander into such remote places?

933
00:44:56,760 --> 00:44:57,840
Look, Father.

934
00:44:58,550 --> 00:45:00,360
You told me to get closer
to Chancellor Liu.

935
00:45:00,440 --> 00:45:02,400
I heard he was going to rest
at Huanghua Stream.

936
00:45:02,710 --> 00:45:03,880
So I went there specially,

937
00:45:04,590 --> 00:45:06,510
hoping to run into him.

938
00:45:07,400 --> 00:45:09,590
I even dressed like a proper scholar

939
00:45:10,360 --> 00:45:11,360
and bought him a gift.

940
00:45:11,710 --> 00:45:12,670
It doesn't hurt anymore?

941
00:45:14,070 --> 00:45:15,960
How can you say that? It hurts!

942
00:45:16,590 --> 00:45:17,570
- It hurts so much...
- Enough.

943
00:45:18,840 --> 00:45:19,400
Drop the act.

944
00:45:20,590 --> 00:45:22,150
When have you ever planned things

945
00:45:22,400 --> 00:45:23,550
so carefully before?

946
00:45:24,070 --> 00:45:25,030
Did someone put you up to this?

947
00:45:31,300 --> 00:45:35,900
(Next Episode Preview)

948
00:45:36,150 --> 00:45:37,960
I have one more favor to ask.

949
00:45:38,840 --> 00:45:40,510
I beg you to send me to the palace

950
00:45:40,920 --> 00:45:42,190
to serve as a palace eunuch.

951
00:45:44,630 --> 00:45:45,670
Well said, Liu Wenji.

952
00:45:46,360 --> 00:45:47,280
I didn't want to help you,

953
00:45:47,880 --> 00:45:49,960
but I've changed my mind.

954
00:45:52,280 --> 00:45:55,573
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

955
00:45:58,258 --> 00:46:03,174
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

956
00:46:05,368 --> 00:46:11,213
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

957
00:46:11,713 --> 00:46:16,939
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

958
00:46:19,708 --> 00:46:24,499
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

959
00:46:25,335 --> 00:46:31,414
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

960
00:46:33,215 --> 00:46:36,365
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

961
00:46:36,365 --> 00:46:38,013
♪Burning bright as a song♪

962
00:46:38,065 --> 00:46:41,789
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

963
00:46:42,167 --> 00:46:46,833
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

964
00:46:47,452 --> 00:46:51,493
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

965
00:46:51,984 --> 00:46:54,099
♪Not a single hour less♪

966
00:46:54,139 --> 00:47:01,085
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

967
00:47:01,848 --> 00:47:05,301
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

968
00:47:05,481 --> 00:47:08,626
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

969
00:47:09,065 --> 00:47:15,702
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

970
00:47:16,099 --> 00:47:18,137
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

971
00:47:18,137 --> 00:47:20,613
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

972
00:47:20,651 --> 00:47:23,120
♪You're the only one I need♪

973
00:47:23,324 --> 00:47:30,211
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

974
00:47:30,523 --> 00:47:33,794
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

975
00:47:34,099 --> 00:47:37,272
♪My last untouched innocence♪

976
00:47:37,596 --> 00:47:41,022
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

977
00:47:41,255 --> 00:47:44,480
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

978
00:47:44,811 --> 00:47:51,607
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

979
00:47:51,976 --> 00:47:54,038
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

980
00:47:54,039 --> 00:47:56,542
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

981
00:47:56,589 --> 00:47:58,927
♪You're the only one I need♪

982
00:47:59,158 --> 00:48:05,993
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

983
00:48:06,342 --> 00:48:07,960
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

984
00:48:08,090 --> 00:48:09,886
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

985
00:48:10,243 --> 00:48:13,260
♪You're the only one I need♪

986
00:48:13,300 --> 00:48:14,627
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)

